  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Sắp xếp mẫu số liệu theo thứ tự không giảm ta được:<br><div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>17</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>18</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>;</mo></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>29</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>33</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>34</mn><mo>;</mo></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>37</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>38</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>39</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tCỡ mẫu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là số lẻ nên trung vị của mẫu số liệu này là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>23</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ nhất là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ ba là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>34</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>35</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Bảng tần số ghép nhóm của mẫu số liệu như sau:\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Số câu trả lời đúng</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>21</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>25</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>26</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>35</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td>Số học sinh</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>6</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>8</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>8</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>13</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></li><li>Do số câu trả lời đúng của học sinh là số nguyên nên ta hiệu chỉnh lại bảng số liệu như sau:\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td>Số câu trả lời đúng</td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\"